# Files whose exact bytes are hashed by sealed study records:
#   artifacts/handoff/policy_v3/validation-policy-v3-66054ed84c02e348/prespec.json  (alert policy v3)
#   artifacts/reports/test_v1/prespec.json                                        (locked test evaluation)
#   artifacts/reports/robustness_retrain_v1/prespec.json                          (retraining sensitivity)
