# Re-running a study checks these hashes and refuses changed files. The hashes were taken on the line endings below
# (Windows checkouts for most, LF for files created later), so every checkout on any OS reproduces those bytes.
# Do not change these lines or the files; a change starts a new, labelled study. New .py files in src/aki_eval,
# src/aki_final or src/aki_robustness also change the recorded file sets.
# notebook 02's run manifest recorded configs/ml.yaml with LF endings (same content); that hash only names the run.

